From 12d2e282c039f0ae526c40e39d6168e195bbcb01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:33:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corvid v1.5: viewer codes for the players

A channel's HLS stream and preview picture can be asked for with a code in
the path (/memfs/k/<code>/<channel>.m3u8): a viewer's guest key for watching
the channel, the watch key, or a ticket of the panel (GET /api/v3/fork/hlsticket,
signed with a key from the JWT secret). Channels listed under
"protectedPlayers" in the UI's system metadata can only be watched with a
code; the others stay open.

